  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Customization/Style_Book?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><span><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/aa/Help.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/70?cb=20171216152011\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>The following list is <b>incomplete</b>. You can help the Hay Day Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"/wiki/customization-style-book-29422\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">adding</a> missing information.\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>\n</p><p>When <a href=\"/wiki/customization-29379\" title=\"Customization\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">customizing</a> their farms, players can complete full styles for their <a href=\"/wiki/farmhouse-7542\" title=\"Farmhouse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farmhouses</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trucks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shops</a>. This lists all possible looks.\n</p><p>Note that only options players are displaying at the moment are shown as active in the Style Book. Moreover, players need to display all three options at the same time to be able to unlock the style.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Farmhouse</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/66/Farmhouse_Barn_Style.png/revision/latest?cb=20180416230157\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Farmhouse Barn Style\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/66/Farmhouse_Barn_Style.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20180416230157\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><br><b>Barn</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Black Planks</li>\n<li>Red Barn</li>\n<li>Barn</li>\n<li>Reward</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>200,000<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></li>\n<li>35<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></li>\n<li>50<span>greenv</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"greenv\"><img alt=\"greenv\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></li>\n<li>15<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/85/Farmhouse_Blue_Style.png/revision/latest?cb=20180416221729\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Farmhouse Blue Style\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><br><b>Blue</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Blue Open Gable</li>\n<li>Teal Planks</li>\n<li>Full Balcony</li>\n<li>Reward</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>50,000<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-el